  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Water ESSENCE Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Water ESSENCE Africa - creating synergy to meet the global challenges project addresses the challanges related to unevenly distributed freshwater. The proejct addresses these challanges through a matrix of three vertical cross-disciplinary issues on health, climate change, and energy, and two horizontal topics: gender equality and digitalisation of education.</narrative>
  </description>
